ual questions: whether any supported configuration (multi-replica client, Dreply=false, per-RPC replies) can reorder replies, the still-unchecked A1 fast path and A2 authority transitions, unread A4 membership and A6 durability, and the earlier Accept-reply latency/ballot-range residual. Preflight validation returns valid=true; formal acceptance and any execution remain the controller's.\"}"}}
